From 983fa3d425e8b128186881090b910f9a51265073 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Diego <me@diegonmarcos.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 15:05:03 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 09/15] Cloud-Dialer: updater declares PACKAGE_SOURCE_STORE
 (fix ECM 'restricted setting' role denial)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Root cause of losing the default-Phone-app eligibility: the in-app updater's
PackageInstaller session never called setPackageSource(), so Android 14/15
Enhanced Confirmation Mode classified each self-update as an untrusted sideload
and marked the app RESTRICTED — Settings then denied granting ROLE_DIALER /
ROLE_CALL_SCREENING ('Se ha denegado el acceso… permiso restringido').

The GHCR fleet updater is the constellation's own app store → declare
PACKAGE_SOURCE_STORE (API 33+ guarded). Already-restricted installs still need
the one-time manual unblock: App info → ⋮ → Allow restricted settings.
---
 .../kotlin/org/fossify/phone/updater/UpdateInstaller.kt  | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/app/src/main/kotlin/org/fossify/phone/updater/UpdateInstaller.kt b/app/src/main/kotlin/org/fossify/phone/updater/UpdateInstaller.kt
index 756c2d80..fcdb1143 100644
--- a/app/src/main/kotlin/org/fossify/phone/updater/UpdateInstaller.kt
+++ b/app/src/main/kotlin/org/fossify/phone/updater/UpdateInstaller.kt
@@ -24,6 +24,15 @@ internal class UpdateInstaller(private val context: Context) {
             if (Build.VERSION.SDK_INT >= Build.VERSION_CODES.S) {
                 setRequireUserAction(PackageInstaller.SessionParams.USER_ACTION_REQUIRED)
             }
+            if (Build.VERSION.SDK_INT >= Build.VERSION_CODES.TIRAMISU) {
+                // Without an explicit package source, Android 14/15 Enhanced
+                // Confirmation Mode treats the install as untrusted-sideload and
+                // RESTRICTS the installed app: Settings then refuses to grant it
+                // protected roles (default Phone app / call screening) with the
+                // "restricted setting" denial. Our GHCR fleet updater IS the
+                // constellation's app store, so declare PACKAGE_SOURCE_STORE.
+                setPackageSource(PackageInstaller.PACKAGE_SOURCE_STORE)
+            }
         }
         val sessionId = installer.createSession(params)
         installer.openSession(sessionId).use { session ->
